---
name: no-direct-apps-checkout
enabled: true
event: PreToolUse
pattern: Bash
action: block
---

**Do not switch branches directly in `{{ apps_dir }}/` directories.**

Branch switching in the main checkout can disrupt worktrees and other parallel work.

Instead:
1. Use `kimono wt add <repo> <branch>` to create a worktree for the branch.
2. Use `kimono wt feature <name> --new` for cross-repo feature branches.
3. Work in the worktree directory under `{{ worktree_dir }}/`.

This rule prevents accidental branch switches in the main checkout.
